/* ================= MULTI-USER READINESS =================
   When DRS runs on many phones with a shared server (ANTS), each person's daily records stay with them,
   so screens that summarise other people's work read SHARED data instead:
   - Biologist red flags are published to kc-bioflags-<date> (read by Manager, Curator, Vet, Paravet).
   - Special-duty concerns become animal alerts (shared) so Vet/Paravet/Manager see them.
   - The Data Operator's movement register is built from shared animal alerts, incidents and shifting.
   - Manager birth/death counts come from shared animal alerts. */
